{
  "name": "Planning Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9918)\n- MPA notification: POST https://mpa-api.example/v1/planning/ready-notify with JSON { requestId, qaResult, audience: \"planning-personnel\" }; auth via **MPA API service credential** (HTTP Header).\n- Failure email: POST https://mpa-api.example/v1/planning/team-alert (same credential) with team \"planning\" and error context from the failed step.\n- Duplicates: requestId tracked in workflow global static data (ignored on repeat).\n- Invalid payload: missing/empty requestId or qaResult → structured log item in execution (ignored, no notification).\n- Notification retries: 2 retries, 30s between attempts on the notify HTTP node only.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -120
      ]
    },
